{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時54分，一名69歲男子報案，指在西貢蠔涌水口工作期間，腳部不慎被困在搬運車的車底。消防員到場將他救出，清醒送到將軍澳醫院治理，警方列意外受傷跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"工人被救出，清醒送將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192807162762498048385619.jpeg/jalIbI1KjHX2ymobsCyRE3zOFet8vHTVQdBVnWTQVZ0\"/><figcaption>工人被救出，清醒送將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>警方經調查後稱，傷者姓吳69歲。他到上址幫朋友維修一部小型搬運車的電池，完成後試車，但車輛翻側壓住其雙腳。意外中他腳部刮傷，送院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"工人被送到將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192808106585755648382574.jpeg/JqGHOFUun7aOhHEoX4qby3uxcqPuw9-SVQl2n1UJdp8\"/><figcaption>工人被送到將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西貢蠔涌村。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192812914457710592314597.jpeg/VT97Prrb8KsnMX9ZOM7JXpCXrklP8vDbiMoD_63KA_8\"/><figcaption>西貢蠔涌村。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:05:33.594333+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:33.844555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:18.258537+00:00","content_hash":"53e96da942189a30f1fa637ddd3cde21d3705e37514a30b29159518d0b58ae65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}